OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers throughout the day,
OL,7,Fthese will be locally heavy at times,
OL,8,Fespecially on northern hills. A windy
OL,9,Fday, locally gusty, especially across
OL,10,Fthe Pennines. Temperatures near the
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers will soon fade to
OL,14,Fleave a largely dry night, with
OL,15,Flengthy clear spells for many. Turning
OL,16,Fchilly in some sheltered rural spots.
OL,17,FWindy, locally gusty, especially on
OL,18,Fhills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
