OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAfter a cool start it will be
OL,6,Fa fine day with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells for many. Windy
OL,8,Fat first, gradually easing. Cloud and
OL,9,Frain arriving overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FEarly
OL,12,Frain clearing to leave drier and
OL,13,Fbrighter conditions Monday. Mostly
OL,14,Fcloudy Tuesday, with brightest skies
OL,15,Fin the east. Band of rain moves
OL,16,Fsoutheast Wednesday. Warmer days, but
OL,17,Fchillier nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
